abstract: "Public Part II origins-of-life archive for the Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics project, including a twelve-paper manuscript spine, supplementary scripts, generated outputs, interactive panels, bibliography, named laws/tests, and a falsification-centered master synthesis. Part II cites CDFD Part I, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20250821, for CDFL, the public flow-constraint-memory language, and aligns the manuscript archive with the public CDFD Runtime."
